  "steps": [
    "Put the bulgur in a heatproof bowl, pour over the boiling water, cover and leave for 10 to 12 minutes until tender and the liquid is absorbed.",
    "Fluff the bulgur with a fork and let it cool for a few minutes so it stays light and separate.",
    "Add the tomatoes, parsley, mint and spring onion to the bulgur.",
    "Stir in the lemon juice, lemon zest, olive oil, salt and black pepper until everything is evenly coated.",
    "Taste and adjust with a little more salt or lemon if needed, then serve immediately or chill for 15 minutes for a colder salad."
